# 41 — a wild image handle viewed as depth gets a depth stand-in. The wild-handle
# substitution (a guest view on an image no create ever produced) only had one
# stand-in, a colour RGBA8 image. A guest that builds its depth/stencil views on
# such a handle (D32S8, 2-layer, eye-sized) then had MoltenVK build a depth view
